    "dose.guide.spiro_not_modelled": "This app records how much spironolactone you took. It does not draw a concentration curve for it, because spironolactone is not part of the estradiol or CPA pharmacokinetic model here. The vertical mark on the chart is the time of a record and nothing more — it is not a level.",
    "inj.guide.title": "Usage & Dosage",
    "inj.guide.safety": "Do NOT use if at high risk for breast cancer or with severe liver impairment!",
    "inj.guide.route_methods": "Routes: Intramuscular injection, Subcutaneous injection",
    "inj.guide.route_warn": "Do not inject if you are not trained!",
    "inj.guide.dosage_title": "Dosage:",
    "inj.guide.dosage_ev": "Estradiol Valerate: 5 mg every 5–7 days / 10 mg every 1–2 weeks",
    "inj.guide.dosage_ec": "Estradiol Cypionate: 5–6 mg every 7 days / 10–12 mg every 14 days",
    "inj.guide.sim_link": "Injectable E2 Simulator (English)",
    "inj.guide.notes_title": "Precautions:",
    "inj.guide.note_1": "Open ampoules correctly to avoid glass cuts / breakage / tiny glass fragments contaminating the solution.",
    "inj.guide.note_2": "Do not inject into the same site repeatedly.",
    "inj.guide.note_3": "Avoid blood vessels. Risk of embolism!",
    "inj.guide.note_4": "Avoid nerves. For IM injections, inject within safe zones.",
    "inj.guide.note_5": "Since the solution is oil-based, use a 12-gauge (pink, 18G) needle to draw and a 6-gauge (blue, 23G/25G) to inject.",
    "inj.guide.note_6": "Quick needle insertion and using a fresh needle for injection helps reduce pain.",
    "inj.guide.note_7": "For self-injection, use the vastus lateralis (outer mid-thigh) or deltoid (vaccine site).",
    "inj.guide.note_8": "If you feel severe pain or see significant blood flashback when inserting the needle, withdraw immediately, replace the needle, and change injection site.",
    "inj.guide.note_9": "If you experience more bleeding than usual after an injection (but it stops), this is normal—do not panic.",
    "inj.guide.source": "Source: MtF.wiki",
